    "id": "ml-workflow",
    "caption": "An honest supervised-learning workflow: the test set is split off first and touched once at the very end, preprocessing lives inside the pipeline so its statistics come only from training data, and the validation set is where models are compared and tuned.",
    "alt": "Labelled data is split into training, validation and test sets. A pipeline containing preprocessing and the model is fitted on the training set only. The validation set is used to compare models and tune settings, repeatedly. The chosen pipeline is evaluated once on the test set for an honest estimate, then deployed and monitored.",
